sVWhen we collect your Personal Data, we will provide a means for you to opt-out of Certain sharing your Personal Data with our business partners.
p10
I1
sVIf you choose not to provide the Personal Data we request, you can still visit most of the Certain-Powered Websites, but you may be unable to access certain options, offers and services (such as Certain software) that involve our interaction with you.
